    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">WayPulse operates strictly as a client telemetry transmitter to the server endpoint you configure. Location, battery level, and device identifier are transmitted solely to your specified server over OsmAnd, GT06, H02, TK103, Teltonika, or JT808. No location data is sold or shared with third-party advertisers. Passwords are stored locally using salted cryptographic hashing.</string>
